## **Local SEO Checklist for this Page:**
1.  **Unique Content:** Ensure at least 50% of the text is different from other area pages.
2.  **Internal Linking:** Link this page from your main "Services" page and your "Contact" page.
3.  **Google Maps:** Embed a Google Map centered on **[Area Name]** at the bottom of the page.
4.  **NAP Consistency:** Ensure your business Name, Address, and Phone number match your Google Business Profile.
5.  **Image Alt Text:** Include the area name in the alt text of your images (e.g., "Web design portfolio Bedfordview").
